{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Incorporeal</strong> is a top-down isometric dungeon crawler where you can sever your soul from your body. Dash past traps, evade vengeful spirits, and send your spectral form to fight while having to defend your body. Solve puzzles and battle enemies to escape with the relics you seek, but only those who survive the catacombs can walk away with the treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977270/extras/24f88d654d8f09847717f6a00b374bba.poster.avif?t=1760641964\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977270/extras/24f88d654d8f09847717f6a00b374bba.webm?t=1760641964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977270/extras/24f88d654d8f09847717f6a00b374bba.mp4?t=1760641964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your body is exposed when your soul is unleashed, yet only through it can you battle foes. While your spectral form strikes at enemies by dashing through them, your fragile body remains vulnerable to traps and attacks. Success demands careful coordination; dodge incoming dangers, reposition your body, and time your soul\u2019s actions precisely. Every encounter becomes a tense dance between offense and defense, forcing you to think on two fronts at once as fight to escape the catacombs alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977270/extras/8dd264b8e3617aef3fc7eaddb1c01090.poster.avif?t=1760641964\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977270/extras/8dd264b8e3617aef3fc7eaddb1c01090.webm?t=1760641964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977270/extras/8dd264b8e3617aef3fc7eaddb1c01090.mp4?t=1760641964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To succeed, you\u2019ll need precision, cunning, and nerves of steel, balancing the fragile safety of your body with the power of your spectral soul. The relics are yours for the taking, but only if you can outsmart the dangers, overcome your enemies, and escape alive. Do you have what it takes to walk away with them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977270/extras/612d590a83589eb0010e83ff59eebd90.poster.avif?t=1760641964\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977270/extras/612d590a83589eb0010e83ff59eebd90.webm?t=1760641964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977270/extras/612d590a83589eb0010e83ff59eebd90.mp4?t=1760641964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3977270?t=1760641964","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977270/7c80548b7a74c197808889e3acb8aeb97ae21576/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760641964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977270/2ee2d3b0dbdbaa62ed8cf4cb8771d7533da24acd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760641964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977270/2ee2d3b0dbdbaa62ed8cf4cb8771d753